pulsaros-airpods (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The extension reads the state of a bundled daemon (Apple Accessory Protocol):
    listening modes, adaptive level, Conversation Awareness, One-Bud ANC, ear
    detection, AirPods Pro 3 and Max 2
  * The daemon is the omarchy-pods daemon (GPL-3.0), vendored in daemon/ and built
    from source; it runs as the systemd user service librepods
  * Low-battery notifications at 20, 10 and 5 percent
  * The v1 Python daemon and its D-Bus service are removed

 -- Victor Rosario <hello@victorrosario.dev>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

